para('Harshness summarizes the direction',r'''Teachers with similar average harshness may nevertheless disagree about which students should repeat. We measure this disagreement by calculating, for each student profile, the proportion of distinct teacher pairs giving different recommendations. We then summarize disagreement across profiles, giving greater weight to those evaluated more frequently. We report this measure both overall and for the four combinations of failed subjects and competences.''')
